d 'XTXAI': module providing explainability tools for estimation and machine-learning models
d
d   XTXAI is a practical and extensible tool that connects
d traditional econometric analysis with modern explainable
d machine-learning methods, particularly for researchers working
d with panel data, heterogeneous relationships, and dynamic models. d
d KW: econometrics
d KW: machine learning
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261006
d
d Author:  Zehra Yalnız,  Kocaeli University
d Support: email zehrayalnizz41@@gmail.com
d
f xtxai.ado
f xtxai.sthlp
f xtxaiml_engine.py
f xtxaiml_pssa_engine.py
